OL,3,AFrance accuses Iran of supermarket
OL,4,Afridge hacking
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrance has accused Iran of being behind
OL,7,Fcyber-attacks that raised the
OL,8,Ftemperatures of supermarket fridges and
OL,9,Ffreezers.
OL,11,FSpeaking at a news conference, French
OL,12,FForeign Minister Jean-Noel Barrot said
OL,13,Fthe attack was carried out by the
OL,14,FIslamic Revolutionary Guard Corps
OL,15,F(IRGC) of Iran.
OL,17,FHe said the attack was "unprecedented
OL,18,Fin both its scale and its level of
OL,19,Faggression", adding that the country
OL,20,Fwould "implement sanctions at the
OL,21,FEuropean level against all those
OL,22,Fresponsible for this attack."
